  "description": "The Teammachine SLR 01 SIX is undeniably Teammachine, with the ultimate race-bred geometry, iconic silhouette, and Impec Lab obsession to make it lighter, sharper, faster through targeted stiffness and responsiveness.\nIts refined carbon layup using our 01 Pro Carbon grade is unapologetically stiff, giving exceptional power transfer on the uphills and sharp handling on the downs. It’s light where it counts, aero where it matters, and engineered in a package that opens up BMC SLR 01 level to more riders.\nTCC Race compliance adds smoothness without compromising on stiffness, giving it that unmistakable BMC confidence across every road surface.\nKeeping the BMC SLR 01 mentality, we’ve rounded out this model with a Shimano Ultegra Di2 groupset with 4iiii power meter for reliable shifting and on-ride performance data, with the pairing of an integrated BMC ICS 2 stem with 01 Premium Carbon handlebars offering a versatile and clean cockpit. All rolling on our CR 40 tubeless-ready carbon wheels, ready for all gradients.",
